ually as a subscription\nD. Monthly as a subscription"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 42","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q043","topicId":"topic-2","title":"Question 43","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Which REST API endpoint is used to modify details about a GitHub Copilot Business subscription? Each correct answer part of the solution. (Choose two.)"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"multiple_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Add teams to the Copilot subscription for an organization."},{"id":"b","label":"Remove teams from the Copilot subscription for an organization."},{"id":"c","label":"Upgrade or downgrade the subscription tier"},{"id":"d","label":"Migrate Copilot seat assignments between GitHub organizations"},{"id":"e","label":"Reassign Copilot seats based on GitHub repository size"}],"correctOptionIds":["a","b"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nA. Add teams to the Copilot subscription for an organization.\nB. Remove teams from the Copilot subscription for an organization."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 43","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q044","topicId":"topic-2","title":"Question 44","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Which of the following is the correct way to access the audit log events for GitHub Copilot Business?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Use the Audit log section in the organization’s GitHub settings"},{"id":"b","label":"Navigate to the Insights tab in the repository settings"},{"id":"c","label":"Use the Code tab in the GitHub repository"},{"id":"d","label":"Navigate to the Security tab in the organization’s GitHub settings"}],"correctOptionIds":["a"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from g