n will be most cost effective to allow them to manage users with their Identity Provider (e.g. Okta)?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"GitHub Copilot Individual"},{"id":"b","label":"GitHub Copilot Enterprise"},{"id":"c","label":"GitHub Copilot Teams"},{"id":"d","label":"GitHub Copilot Business for non-GHE customers"}],"correctOptionIds":["d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nD. GitHub Copilot Business for non-GHE customers"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 47","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q048","topicId":"topic-3","title":"Question 48","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What is a likely effect of GitHub Copilot being trained on commonly used code patterns?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Suggest completely novel projects, while reducing time on a project."},{"id":"b","label":"Suggest innovative coding solutions that are not yet popular."},{"id":"c","label":"Suggest homogeneous solutions if provided a diverse data set."},{"id":"d","label":"Suggest code snippets that reflect the most common practices in the training data."}],"correctOptionIds":["d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nD. Suggest code snippets that reflect the most common practices in the training data."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 48","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q049","topicId":"topic-3","title":"Question 49","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"How does GitHub Copilot typically handle code suggestions that involve deprecated features or syntax of programming languages?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"GitHub Copilot always filters out deprecated elements to promote the use of current standards."},{"id":"b","label":"GitHub Copilot may suggest deprecated syntax or features if they are present in its training data."},{"id":"c","label":"GitHub Copilot rejects all prompts involving deprecated features to avoid compilation errors."},{"id":"d","label":"GitHub Copilot automatically updates deprecated features in its suggestions to the latest version."}],"correctOptionIds":["b"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nB. GitHub Copilot may suggest deprecated syntax or features if they are present in its training data."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 49","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q050","topicId":"topic-3","title":"Question 50","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Identify the steps involved in the life cycle of a GitHub Copilot code suggestion? Each correct answer presents part of the solution. (Choose two.)"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"multiple_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Processing telemetry data"},{"id":"b","label":"Generate suggestions"},{"id":"c","label":"Retraining the model"},{"id":"d","label":"Storing user data"},{"id":"e","label":"Capturing the user’s context"}],"correctOptionIds":["b","e"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nB. Generate suggestions\nE. Capturing the user’s context"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 50","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q051","topicId":"topic-3","title":"Question 51","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What role does the pre-processing of user input play in the data flow of GitHub Copilot Chat?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"It formats the output response before presenting it to the user."},{"id":"b","label":"It filters out irrelevant information from the user’s input prompt."},{"id":"c","label":"It enriches the input prompt with additional context before passing it to the language model."},{"id":"d","label":"It directly generates a response based on the user’s input prompt."}],"correctOptionIds":["c"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nC. It enriches the input prompt with additional context before passing it to the language model."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 51","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q052","topicId":"topic-3","title":"Question 52","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What are the additional checks that need to pass before the GitHub Copilot responses are submitted to the user? Each correct answer presents part of the solution. (Choose two.)"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"multiple_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Code quality"},{"id":"b","label":"Compatibility with user-specific settings"},{"id":"c","label":"Performance benchmarking"},{"id":"d","label":"Suggestions matching public code (optional based on settings)"}],"correctOptionIds":["a","d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nA. Code quality\nD. Suggestions matching public code (optional based on settings)"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 52","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q053","topicId":"topic-3","title":"Question 53","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What are the potential limitations of GitHub Copilot Chat? Each correct answer presents part of the solution. (Choose two.)"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"multiple_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Ability to handle complex code structures"},{"id":"b","label":"Limited training data"},{"id":"c","label":"Extensive support for all programming languages"},{"id":"d","label":"No biases in code suggestions"}],"correctOptionIds":["a","b"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nA. Ability to handle complex code structures\nB. Limited training data"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 53","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q054","topicId":"topic-3","title":"Question 54","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What is the impact of the “Fill-In-the-Middle” (FIM) technique on GitHub Copilot’s code suggestions?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Improves suggestions by considering both the prefix and suffix of the code, filling in the middle part more accurately."},{"id":"b","label":"Restricts Copilot to use only external databases for generating code suggestions."},{"id":"c","label":"Allows Copilot to generate suggestions based only on the prefix of the code."},{"id":"d","label":"Ignores both the prefix and suffix of the code, focusing only on user comments for context."}],"correctOptionIds":["a"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nA. Improves suggestions by considering both the prefix and suffix of the code, filling in the middle part more accurately."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 54","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q055","topicId":"topic-3","title":"Question 55","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Which of the following statements correctly describes how GitHub Copilot Individual uses prompt data? Each correct answer presents part of the solution. (Choose two.)"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"multiple_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Real-time user input helps generate context-aware code suggestions."},{"id":"b","label":"Prompt data is used internally by GitHub for improving the search engine."},{"id":"c","label":"Prompt data is used to train machine learning models for better code suggestions."},{"id":"d","label":"Prompt data is stored unencrypted for faster processing."}],"correctOptionIds":["a","c"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nA. Real-time user input helps generate context-aware code suggestions.\nC. Prompt data is used to train machine learning models for better code suggestions."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 55","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q056","topicId":"topic-3","title":"Question 56","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What is used by GitHub Copilot in the IDE to determine the prompt context?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Information from the IDE like open tabs, cursor location, selected code."},{"id":"b","label":"All the code visible in the current IDE."},{"id":"c","label":"All the code in the current repository and any git submodules."},{"id":"d","label":"The open tabs in the IDE and the current folder of the terminal."}],"correctOptionIds":["a"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nA. Information from the IDE like open tabs, cursor location, selected code."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 56","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q057","topicId":"topic-3","title":"Question 57","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Which of the following does GitHub Copilot’s LLM derive context from when producing a response?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Version control system integrated with the IDE"},{"id":"b","label":"Syntax highlighting scheme of the code in the IDE"},{"id":"c","label":"Frequency of commits to the repository"},{"id":"d","label":"Neighboring or related files within a project"}],"correctOptionIds":["d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nD. Neighboring or related files within a project"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 57","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q058","topicId":"topic-3","title":"Question 58","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What is a benefit of using custom models in GitHub Copilot?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Responses use the organization’s LLM engine"},{"id":"b","label":"Responses are faster to produce and appear sooner"},{"id":"c","label":"Responses are guaranteed to be correct"},{"id":"d","label":"Responses use practices and patterns in your repositories"}],"correctOptionIds":["d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nD. Responses use practices and patterns in your repositories"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 58","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q059","topicId":"topic-3","title":"Question 59","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"How does GitHub Copilot identify matching code and ensure that public code is appropriately handled or blocked? Each correct answer presents part of the solution. (Choose two.)"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"multiple_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Implementing safeguards to detect and avoid suggesting verbatim snippets from public code"},{"id":"b","label":"Filtering out suggestions that match code from public repositories"},{"id":"c","label":"Using machine learning models trained only on private repositories"},{"id":"d","label":"Reviewing and storing user-specific private repository data for future suggestions"}],"correctOptionIds":["a","b"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nA. Implementing safeguards to detect and avoid suggesting verbatim snippets from public code\nB. Filtering out suggestions that match code from public repositories"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 59","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q060","topicId":"topic-3","title":"Question 60","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"How does GitHub Copilot utilize chat history to enhance its code completion capabilities?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"By sharing chat history with third-party services to improve integration and functionality."},{"id":"b","label":"By analyzing past chat interactions to identify common programming patterns and errors."},{"id":"c","label":"By logging chat history to monitor user activity and ensure compliance with coding standards."},{"id":"d","label":"By using chat history to offer personalized code snippets based on previous prompts."}],"correctOptionIds":["d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nD. By using chat history to offer personalized code snippets based on previous prompts."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 60","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q061","topicId":"topic-3","title":"Question 61","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What is the main purpose of the duplication detection filter in GitHub Copilot?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"To compare user-generated code against a private repository for potential matches."},{"id":"b","label":"To encourage the user to follow coding best practices preventing code duplication."},{"id":"c","label":"To allow administrators to control which suggestions are visible to developers based on custom criteria."},{"id":"d","label":"To detect and block suggestions that match public code snippets on GitHub if they contain about 150 characters."}],"correctOptionIds":["d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nD. To detect and block suggestions that match public code snippets on GitHub if they contain about 150 characters."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 61","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q062","topicId":"topic-3","title":"Question 62","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Where is the proxy service hosted?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Amazon Web Service"},{"id":"b","label":"Self hosted"},{"id":"c","label":"Microsoft Azure"},{"id":"d","label":"Google Cloud Platform"}],"correctOptionIds":["c"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nC. Microsoft Azure"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 62","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q063","topicId":"topic-3","title":"Question 63","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"How can GitHub Copilot assist developers during the requirements analysis phase of the Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC)?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"By managing stakeholder communication and meetings."},{"id":"b","label":"By automatically generating detailed requirements documents."},{"id":"c","label":"By providing templates and code snippets that help in documenting requirements."},{"id":"d","label":"By identifying and fixing potential requirement conflicts when using /help."}],"correctOptionIds":["c"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) 