ide examples of expected input and output within the prompt."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 65","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q066","topicId":"topic-4","title":"Question 66","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What is zero-shot prompting?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Giving GitHub Copilot examples of the algorithm and outcome you want to use"},{"id":"b","label":"Only giving GitHub Copilot a question as a prompt and no examples"},{"id":"c","label":"Giving GitHub Copilot examples of the problem you want to solve"},{"id":"d","label":"Giving as little context to GitHub Copilot as possible"},{"id":"e","label":"Telling GitHub Copilot it needs to show only the correct answer"}],"correctOptionIds":["b"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nB. Only giving GitHub Copilot a question as a prompt and no examples"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 66","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q067","topicId":"topic-4","title":"Question 67","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What are the different ways to give context to GitHub Copilot to get more precise responses? Each correct answer presents part of the solution. (Choose two.)"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"multiple_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Engage with chat participants such as @workspace to incorporate collaborative context into the responses."},{"id":"b","label":"Access developer’s previous projects and code repositories to understand their coding style without explicit permission."},{"id":"c","label":"Utilize to interpret developer’s thoughts and intentions without any code or comments."},{"id":"d","label":"Utilize chat variables like #file and #editors to anchor the conversation within the specific 