ulatory standards across industries."},{"id":"d","label":"By autonomously refactoring entire codebases to the latest programming language."}],"correctOptionIds":["a","b"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nA. By providing suggestions for improving code readability and maintainability based on best practices.\nB. By offering code transformation examples that enhance performance and reduce complexity."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 73","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q074","topicId":"topic-5","title":"Question 74","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What is one of the recommended practices when using GitHub Copilot Chat to enhance code quality?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Rely solely on Copilot’s suggestions without reviewing them."},{"id":"b","label":"Regularly review and refactor the code suggested by Copilot."},{"id":"c","label":"Disable Copilot’s inline suggestions."},{"id":"d","label":"Avoid using Copilot for complex tasks."}],"correctOptionIds":["b"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nB. Regularly review and refactor the code suggested by Copilot."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 74","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q075","topicId":"topic-5","title":"Question 75","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"In what ways can GitHub Copilot contribute to the design phase of the Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC)?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"GitHub Copilot can generate user interface (UI) prototypes without prompting."},{"id":"b","label":"GitHub Copilot can suggest design patterns and best practices relevant to the project."},{"id":"c","label":"GitHub Cop