human collaboration."},{"id":"d","label":"GitHub Copilot can automatically handle project management tasks."}],"correctOptionIds":["b"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nB. GitHub Copilot allows developers to stay in their IDE."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 77","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q078","topicId":"topic-5","title":"Question 78","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What are the potential limitations of GitHub Copilot in maintaining existing codebases?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"GitHub Copilot’s suggestions are always aware of the entire codebase."},{"id":"b","label":"GitHub Copilot can refactor and optimize the entire codebase up to 10,000 lines of code."},{"id":"c","label":"GitHub Copilot can independently manage and resolve all merge conflicts in version control."},{"id":"d","label":"GitHub Copilot might not fully understand the context and dependencies within a large codebase."}],"correctOptionIds":["d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nD. GitHub Copilot might not fully understand the context and dependencies within a large codebase."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 78","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q079","topicId":"topic-5","title":"Question 79","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"How can GitHub Copilot aid developers in writing documentation for their code?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"GitHub Copilot can suggest summaries or descriptions based on the code’s functionality."},{"id":"b","label":"GitHub Copilot can only generate content in markdown format."},{"id":"c","label":"GitHub Copilot can automatically generate complete and detailed documentation."},{"id":"d","label":"GitHub Copilot cannot assist in writing documentation or comments."}],"correctOptionIds":["a"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nA. GitHub Copilot can suggest summaries or descriptions based on the code’s functionality."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 79","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q080","topicId":"topic-5","title":"Question 80","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"How does GitHub Copilot assist developers in reducing the amount of manual boilerplate code they write?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"By refactoring the entire codebase to eliminate boilerplate code without developer input."},{"id":"b","label":"By suggesting code snippets that can be reused across different parts of the project."},{"id":"c","label":"By engaging in real-time collaboration with multiple developers to write boilerplate code."},{"id":"d","label":"By predicting future coding requirements and pre-emptively generating boilerplate code"}],"correctOptionIds":["b"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nB. By suggesting code snippets that can be reused across different parts of the project."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 80","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q081","topicId":"topic-5","title":"Question 81","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Which scenarios can GitHub Copilot Chat be used to increase productivity? Each correct answer presents part of the solution. (Choose two.)"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"multiple_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Create a documentation file for the newly created code base."},{"id":"b","label":"Fast tracking of release management activities to move c