atical results in real-time."},{"id":"c","label":"GitHub Copilot’s automatic update of outdated mathematical formulas to modern standards."},{"id":"d","label":"GitHub Copilot’s reliance on pattern-based responses without verifying computation accuracy."}],"correctOptionIds":["d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nD. GitHub Copilot’s reliance on pattern-based responses without verifying computation accuracy."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 90","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q091","topicId":"topic-6","title":"Question 91","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"When using GitHub Copilot Chat to generate boilerplate code for various test types, how can you guide the AI to follow the testing standards of your company?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"By using a specific slash command in the prompt."},{"id":"b","label":"By using a specific command in the terminal."},{"id":"c","label":"By using a specific setting in GitHub Copilot’s configuration."},{"id":"d","label":"By using specific prompt examples in your chat request."}],"correctOptionIds":["d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nD. By using specific prompt examples in your chat request."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 91","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q092","topicId":"topic-6","title":"Question 92","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"When using GitHub Copilot to identify missing tests in your codebase, which of the following is the most important factor to consider?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Having a high test coverage percentage in the codebase."},{"id":"b","label":"Using well-known coding practices in