rect answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nC. /tests"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 94","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q095","topicId":"topic-6","title":"Question 95","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Which of the following statements best describes the impact of GitHub Copilot on the software development process?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"It decreases software vulnerabilities from third party dependencies."},{"id":"b","label":"It increases productivity by automating repetitive coding tasks."},{"id":"c","label":"It reduces developer overhead by automating testing workflows."},{"id":"d","label":"It replaces the need for developers in the software development process."}],"correctOptionIds":["b"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nB. It increases productivity by automating repetitive coding tasks."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 95","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q096","topicId":"topic-6","title":"Question 96","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Identify the right use cases where GitHub Copilot Chat is most effective. Each correct answer presents part of the solution. (Choose two.)"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"multiple_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Creation of end-to-end performance testing scenarios for a web application"},{"id":"b","label":"Creation of a unit test scenario for newly developed Python code"},{"id":"c","label":"Create a technical requirement specification from the business requirement documentation"},{"id":"d","label":"Explain a legacy COBOL code and translate the code to another language like C#"}],"correctOptionIds":["b","d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nB. Creation of