They need to exclude specific files from being used to inform code completion suggestions. How can they achieve this?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Upgrade to Copilot Business"},{"id":"b","label":"Add a .gitignore file to the repo"},{"id":"c","label":"Have an organization owner configure content exclusions"},{"id":"d","label":"Have a repo administrator configure content exclusions"},{"id":"e","label":"Use the #file Chat variable to exclude the files"}],"correctOptionIds":["a"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nA. Upgrade to Copilot Business"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 105","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q106","topicId":"topic-7","title":"Question 106","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What do you check when GitHub Copilot content exclusions are not working? Each correct answer presents part of the solution. (Choose two.)"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"multiple_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"If GitHub Copilot can connect to the server selected in your user settings."},{"id":"b","label":"If the user is in an organization that has content exclusions configured."},{"id":"c","label":"If the content exclusion settings changed in the last 30 minutes or before that."},{"id":"d","label":"If the user is part of the content exclusion team that limits the use of content exclusions."}],"correctOptionIds":["b","c"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nB. If the user is in an organization that has content exclusions configured.\nC. If the content exclusion settings changed in the last 30 minutes or before that."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 106","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q107","topicId":"topic-7","title":"Question 107","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What practices enhance the quality of suggestions provided GitHub Copilot? (Choose three.)"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"multiple_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Using meaningful variable names"},{"id":"b","label":"Clearly defining the problem or task"},{"id":"c","label":"Including personal information in the code comments"},{"id":"d","label":"Providing examples of desired output"},{"id":"e","label":"Use a gitignore file to exclude irrelevant files"}],"correctOptionIds":["a","b","d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nA. Using meaningful variable names\nB. Clearly defining the problem or task\nD. Providing examples of desired output"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 107","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q108","topicId":"topic-7","title":"Question 108","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What is a key consideration when relying on GitHub Copilot Chat’s explanations of code functionality and proposed improvements?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"The explanations are primarily derived from user-provided documentation."},{"id":"b","label":"The explanations are dynamically updated based on user feedback."},{"id":"c","label":"GitHub Copilot Chat uses a static database for generating explanations."},{"id":"d","label":"Reviewing and validating the generated output for accuracy and completeness."}],"correctOptionIds":["d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nD. Reviewing and validating the generated output for accuracy and completeness."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 108","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q109","topicId":"topic-7","title":"Question 109","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"How does GitHub Copilot Chat ensure that a function works correctly?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"By automatically writing all the tests for the function."},{"id":"b","label":"By suggesting assertions based on the code’s context and semantics."},{"id":"c","label":"By executing the test cases to validate the correctness of the code."},{"id":"d","label":"By writing the implementation code for the function."}],"correctOptionIds":["b"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nB. By suggesting assertions based on the code’s context and semantics."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 109","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q110","topicId":"topic-7","title":"Question 110","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What is the process behind identifying public code matches when using a public code filter enabled in GitHub Copilot?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Running code suggestions through filters designed to detect public code"},{"id":"b","label":"Comparing suggestions against public code using machine learning"},{"id":"c","label":"Reviewing the user’s browsing history to identify public repositories"},{"id":"d","label":"Analyzing the context and structure of the code being written"}],"correctOptionIds":["a"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nA. Running code suggestions through filters designed to detect public code"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 110","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q111","topicId":"topic-7","title":"Question 111","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What GitHub Copilot feature can be configured at the organization level to prevent GitHub Copilot suggesting publicly available code snippets?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"GitHub Copilot Chat in the IDE"},{"id":"b","label":"GitHub Copilot access to Bing"},{"id":"c","label":"GitHub Copilot duplication detection filter"},{"id":"d","label":"GitHub Copilot Chat in GitHub Mobile"}],"correctOptionIds":["c"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nC. GitHub Copilot duplication detection filter"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 111","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q112","topicId":"topic-7","title":"Question 112","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Which of the following GitHub Copilot Business related activities can be tracked using the organization audit logs?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Accepted chat suggestions"},{"id":"b","label":"Changes to content exclusion settings"},{"id":"c","label":"Code suggestions made by GitHub Copilot"},{"id":"d","label":"Suggestions blocked by duplication detection filtering"}],"correctOptionIds":["b"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nB. Changes to content exclusion settings"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 112","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q113","topicId":"topic-7","title":"Question 113","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"How long does it take content exclusion to add or be updated?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Up to 30 minutes"},{"id":"b","label":"60-90 minutes"},{"id":"c","label":"45-60 minutes"},{"id":"d","label":"24 hours"}],"correctOptionIds":["a"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nA. Up to 30 minutes"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 113","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q114","topicId":"topic-7","title":"Question 114","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"How does GitHub Copilot suggest code optimizations for improved performance?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"By enforcing strict coding standards that ensure optimal performance."},{"id":"b","label":"By providing detailed reports on the performance of the codebase."},{"id":"c","label":"By analyzing the codebase and suggesting more efficient algorithms or data structures."},{"id":"d","label":"By automatically rewriting the codebase to use more efficient code."}],"correctOptionIds":["c"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nC. By analyzing the codebase and suggesting more efficient algorithms or data structures."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 114","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q115","topicId":"topic-7","title":"Question 115","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What is the correct way to exclude specific files from being used by GitHub Copilot Business during code suggestions?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Rename the files to include the suffix_no_copilot"},{"id":"b","label":"Modify the .gitignore file to include the specific files"},{"id":"c","label":"Use the GitHub Copilot settings in the user interface to exclude files"},{"id":"d","label":"Add the specific files to a copilot .ignore file"}],"correctOptionIds":["c"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nC. Use the GitHub Copilot settings in the user interface to exclude files"}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 115","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"gh300-q116","topicId":"topic-7","title":"Question 116","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What are the effects of content exclusions? (Choose two.)"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"multiple_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"The excluded content is not directly available to GitHub Copilot to use a context."},{"id":"b","label":"GitHub Copilot suggestions are no longer available in the excluded files."},{"id":"c","label":"The excluded content is no longer used while debugging the code."},{"id":"d","label":"The IDE will not count coding suggestions in the excluded content."}],"correctOptionIds":["a","b"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from gh-300.json:\nA. The excluded content is not directly available to GitHub Copilot to use a context.\nB. GitHub Copilot suggestions are no longer available in the excluded files."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Question 116","url":""},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}}],"sources":[{"name":"gh-300.json","locator":"Questions 1–116","url":""}],"conversion":{"inputName":"gh-300.json","coverage":"complete","notes":["Preserves all 116 numbered questions, choices, and source-provided answer keys.","The source-provided answer keys are preserved and are not independently certified.","The course remains draft until the content is reviewed for publication."],"unresolved":[]}},"initialAll":false,"initialFilter":"$undefined"}]]
